{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are deployed into a <strong>FRACTURE</strong> system that should have ceased functioning long ago.</i><br><i>The system no longer recognizes your identity, yet insists you execute a series of broken &quot;test protocols.&quot;</i><br><i>You begin traversing the shattered starfield, fighting, and recording.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Until finally \u2014 a mysterious battleship obliterates you.</i><br><i>Not to eliminate you, but to terminate the system that should no longer be running.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Shattered Rift Universe<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/e44187d2ad9beba999255c7f97870bda.poster.avif?t=1747649631\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/e44187d2ad9beba999255c7f97870bda.webm?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/e44187d2ad9beba999255c7f97870bda.mp4?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate and fight across multiple stylistic zones \u2014 from asteroid wreckfields to corrupted mega-stations.<br>Use your Rift Drive to freely traverse an open map scattered with lost system remnants and anomalous phenomena.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bullet Hell Combat &amp; High-Mobility Flight<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/f4fa113726fc669fd637deb86e4365c6.poster.avif?t=1747649631\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/f4fa113726fc669fd637deb86e4365c6.webm?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/f4fa113726fc669fd637deb86e4365c6.mp4?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in tactical top-down battles using boost, warp-dash, and burst propulsion.<br>Adapt your strategy against diverse enemy behaviors and patterns.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/51c17c9da1971153ed1cf9aa55d48341.poster.avif?t=1747649631\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/51c17c9da1971153ed1cf9aa55d48341.webm?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/51c17c9da1971153ed1cf9aa55d48341.mp4?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/cf7d6a7801add4079518539f170f10dd.poster.avif?t=1747649631\" width=796 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/cf7d6a7801add4079518539f170f10dd.webm?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/cf7d6a7801add4079518539f170f10dd.mp4?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon Customization &amp; Upgrade System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip up to 3 weapons per ship: bullets, lasers, missiles, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon supports customizable spread, cooldown, tracking, and energy parameters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade paths extend usage time, reduce cooldown, or unlock special combat modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare weapons possess unique &quot;Rift-Mutated&quot; abilities</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fragmented Narrative Structure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>System Rebooting...</i><br><i>\u2726 Current Node: Executing Test Protocol #001</i><br><i>\u2726 Identity Match Failed: You are not a registered unit</i><br><i>\u2726 Reinitializing Protocol...\u3010Success\u3011</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up among the wreckage of a destroyed fleet.<br>The task system instructs you to activate testing zones, disable interference units, and stabilize system functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything seems routine \u2014 until you complete three tests, and the mysterious battleship appears.<br>It ignores all other targets and annihilates only you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken again. Everything has reset.<br>The system greets you: &quot;This is your first entry.&quot;</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672110?t=1747649631","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672110?t=1747649631","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/7946838a75e387bd68e48ecd138528095a683507/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747649631","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/7946838a75e387bd68e48ecd138528095a683507/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747649631","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are deployed into a <strong>FRACTURE</strong> system that should have ceased functioning long ago.</i><br><i>The system no longer recognizes your identity, yet insists you execute a series of broken &quot;test protocols.&quot;</i><br><i>You begin traversing the shattered starfield, fighting, and recording.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Until finally \u2014 a mysterious battleship obliterates you.</i><br><i>Not to eliminate you, but to terminate the system that should no longer be running.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Shattered Rift Universe<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/e44187d2ad9beba999255c7f97870bda.poster.avif?t=1747649631\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/e44187d2ad9beba999255c7f97870bda.webm?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/e44187d2ad9beba999255c7f97870bda.mp4?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate and fight across multiple stylistic zones \u2014 from asteroid wreckfields to corrupted mega-stations.<br>Use your Rift Drive to freely traverse an open map scattered with lost system remnants and anomalous phenomena.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bullet Hell Combat &amp; High-Mobility Flight<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/f4fa113726fc669fd637deb86e4365c6.poster.avif?t=1747649631\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/f4fa113726fc669fd637deb86e4365c6.webm?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/f4fa113726fc669fd637deb86e4365c6.mp4?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in tactical top-down battles using boost, warp-dash, and burst propulsion.<br>Adapt your strategy against diverse enemy behaviors and patterns.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/51c17c9da1971153ed1cf9aa55d48341.poster.avif?t=1747649631\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/51c17c9da1971153ed1cf9aa55d48341.webm?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/51c17c9da1971153ed1cf9aa55d48341.mp4?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/cf7d6a7801add4079518539f170f10dd.poster.avif?t=1747649631\" width=796 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/cf7d6a7801add4079518539f170f10dd.webm?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/cf7d6a7801add4079518539f170f10dd.mp4?t=1747649631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon Customization &amp; Upgrade System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip up to 3 weapons per ship: bullets, lasers, missiles, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon supports customizable spread, cooldown, tracking, and energy parameters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade paths extend usage time, reduce cooldown, or unlock special combat modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare weapons possess unique &quot;Rift-Mutated&quot; abilities</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fragmented Narrative Structure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>System Rebooting...</i><br><i>\u2726 Current Node: Executing Test Protocol #001</i><br><i>\u2726 Identity Match Failed: You are not a registered unit</i><br><i>\u2726 Reinitializing Protocol...\u3010Success\u3011</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up among the wreckage of a destroyed fleet.<br>The task system instructs you to activate testing zones, disable interference units, and stabilize system functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything seems routine \u2014 until you complete three tests, and the mysterious battleship appears.<br>It ignores all other targets and annihilates only you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken again. Everything has reset.<br>The system greets you: &quot;This is your first entry.&quot;</p>","developers":["Benkimchi"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/ffb70130b227850a88a1f36abb77a91f611e9691/header.jpg?t=1747649631","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3672110/872552/0d7a57593060d7352149713c7a5f941578e43583/1750836158/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745673757","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3672110/872552/0d7a57593060d7352149713c7a5f941578e43583/1750836158/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745673757","highlight":true,"hl