ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/6b1b4235f47b30a15ef9c4b857f3ac76ec521960/ss_6b1b4235f47b30a15ef9c4b857f3ac76ec521960.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747649631","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/6b1b4235f47b30a15ef9c4b857f3ac76ec521960/ss_6b1b4235f47b30a15ef9c4b857f3ac76ec521960.600x338.jpg?t=1747649631"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/0a750a0df95fa933d0a47bcfbf0c175d668ac1c4/ss_0a750a0df95fa933d0a47bcfbf0c175d668ac1c4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747649631","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/0a750a0df95fa933d0a47bcfbf0c175d668ac1c4/ss_0a750a0df95fa933d0a47bcfbf0c175d668ac1c4.600x338.jpg?t=1747649631"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/98ab2d66b6c627e088584b86b8b9fd9552024329/ss_98ab2d66b6c627e088584b86b8b9fd9552024329.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747649631","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/98ab2d66b6c627e088584b86b8b9fd9552024329/ss_98ab2d66b6c627e088584b86b8b9fd9552024329.600x338.jpg?t=1747649631"}],"short_description":"FRACTURE\u00a0is a top-down 3D space shooter RPG, blending open-world exploration and fragmented memory-driven storytelling.It throws you into a recursive war shaped by identity, consciousness, and fate.You haven't come here for the first time\u2014But are you sure... you've ever truly left?","steam_appid":3672110,"support_info":{"email":"benkimchi@outlook.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}